{"id":"7a057444873ebdd2","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-forwardchaining.md","title":"Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules","display":"df-forwardchaining — Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-forwardchaining","aliases":["27-df-forwardchaining"],"display":"df-forwardchaining — Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules","depends_on":["[[27-df-purehorndnf]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§6.4.2 Figure 6.2","source_statement":"Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules","source_printed_pages":"284–285","source_pdf_pages":"308–309","verification_status":"source-construction-checked-synchronous-variant"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-forwardchaining"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-forwardchaining</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-forwardchaining — Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8c66adeeb535366b\" href=\"?note=8c66adeeb535366b\" title=\"27-df-purehorndnf\">27-df-purehorndnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.4.2 Figure 6.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a057444873ebdd2\" href=\"?note=7a057444873ebdd2\" title=\"Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules\">Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"284–285"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"308–309"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-construction-checked-synchronous-variant"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq N\">\\(S\\subseteq N\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c66adeeb535366b\" href=\"?note=8c66adeeb535366b\" title=\"27-df-purehorndnf\">27-df-purehorndnf</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L\">\\(T_L\\)</span> 为文字集 L 的项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R(D)\\coloneqq\\{(A,j)\\in\\mathcal P(N)\\times N:j\\notin A\\land T_{\\{x_i:i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_j\\}}\\in D\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R(D)\\coloneqq\\{(A,j)\\in\\mathcal P(N)\\times N:j\\notin A\\land T_{\\{x_i:i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_j\\}}\\in D\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_0(D,S)\\coloneqq S,\\qquad S_{r+1}(D,S)\\coloneqq S_r(D,S)\\cup\\{j\\in N:\\exists A\\subseteq S_r(D,S)\\;((A,j)\\in\\mathcal R(D))\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N\\land r&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_0(D,S)\\coloneqq S,\\qquad S_{r+1}(D,S)\\coloneqq S_r(D,S)\\cup\\{j\\in N:\\exists A\\subseteq S_r(D,S)\\;((A,j)\\in\\mathcal R(D))\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N\\land r&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FC}_n(D,S)\\coloneqq S_n(D,S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FC}_n(D,S)\\coloneqq S_n(D,S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中每轮取一个可触发头；这里同时添加全部可触发头，给出 n 轮的确定性版本。非稳定轮至少增加一个指标，故 n 轮足以稳定；本节点不声称此同步实现具有原书计数器实现的线性复杂度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-purehorndnf","status":"resolved","id":"8c66adeeb535366b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-purehorndnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules","status":"resolved","id":"7a057444873ebdd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-purehorndnf","status":"resolved","id":"8c66adeeb535366b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$S\\subseteq N$；见 [[27-df-purehorndnf]]。$T_L$ 为文字集 L 的项。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"T_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R(D)\\coloneqq\\{(A,j)\\in\\mathcal P(N)\\times N:j\\notin A\\land T_{\\{x_i:i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_j\\}}\\in D\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"S_0(D,S)\\coloneqq S,\\qquad S_{r+1}(D,S)\\coloneqq S_r(D,S)\\cup\\{j\\in N:\\exists A\\subseteq S_r(D,S)\\;((A,j)\\in\\mathcal R(D))\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N\\land r<n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FC}_n(D,S)\\coloneqq S_n(D,S).","display":true}],"bytes":1544,"backlinks":[{"id":"ff80d886763151d0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$，$\\eta\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$；$\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-hornclosure]]，$\\mathcal R$ 见 [[27-df-forwardchaining]]。$A\\subseteq[n]$。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-forwardchaining|df-forwardchaining — Finite forward chaining on pure Horn rules]]"},{"id":"7a71d4dcf31c11e4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$h=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{FC}_n$ 见 [[27-df-forwardchaining]]，$\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-hornclosure]]。"}],"outgoing":["8c66adeeb535366b"]}